  "col_right L38: a round blot (3.6 by 3.4 points) in the right margin, about 16 points beyond the end of the line, is not transcribed.",
  "col_right L41: the hyphens of «18-20» and «220-221» are printed as small points at mid height (0.6 by 0.7 and 1.2 by 0.7 points).",
